                <p xml:id="KR2b007a-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:23:22.976+09:00">如果不是桀纣那样的暴虐昏君，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:24:41.319+09:00">又遇上汤武王仁德明主的对手</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:25:13.69+09:00">使人民归心，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:25:50.032+09:00">上天赐命的话，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR2b007a_ZHSJ_001-d3d1p4s19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-01-06T04:34:48.3+09:00">君臣之间的名分就只能是做臣子的恪守臣节至死不渝（sic!)了。</seg>
                </p>
